{Lore("Not much about the original Alex is known, apart from that he was friends with Dolly after meeting her at a bus stop, and lived in a "weird and old but decent looking" apartment. At some point, the original Alex was killed by a demon who mimicked his form, causing him to become who he is in today. He captured Scrina and attempted to force her to build a school for him, but Scrina was unable to cooperate with him, so he attempted to sell Scrina instead. When this failed, he built the school himself, but kept Scrina around because he found her to be good for "stress release".It's unknown how the others came to be in Alex's School, or why he wanted to build a school in the first place.")}
